                    130.0,
                    559.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) Give the Company full and correct information, to the best of the employee's ability, regarding the disability and furnish medical certificates from the attending physician, when requested by the Company.",
